 {"name":"Tom Bar","city":"cordoba","type":"cruise_club","description":"Modern gay leather-oriented cocktail bar with an exclusive cruising section and electronic music in central Córdoba.","hours":"Thursday and Sunday 21:00-02:00; Friday-Saturday 23:00-05:00.","link":"https://www.instagram.com/tombar.cba/","location":"Santiago del Estero 90, Córdoba, Argentina","lat":-31.41878,"lng":-64.17755,"vibe":"polished gay leather bar combining cocktails and consensual cruising","q":"Theme nights may add entry expectations and the cruising area becomes busier late.","best":"Read the current event post, arrive with ID and understand house consent rules.","crowd":"Adult gay and bisexual men, leather audiences and respectful queer visitors.","dress":"Leather or dark clubwear encouraged by some events; verify.","staff":"Current guide explicitly identifies its gay, leather and cruising focus.","sources":["https://cordobagay.com/lugares-gay-cordoba/"]},
