 {"name":"CSD Düsseldorf 2026","city":"dusseldorf","description":"Düsseldorf's Christopher Street Day combines demonstration, street festival, stages and community organisations around the Rhine and Johannes-Rau-Platz.","link":"https://www.csd-d.de/","date":"2026-06-04","start_date":"2026-06-04T16:00:00+02:00","end_date":"2026-06-07T20:00:00+02:00","location":"Johannes-Rau-Platz and central Düsseldorf, Germany","lat":51.22070,"lng":6.76620,"vibe":"Rhine-side Pride demonstration and community street festival","q":"Parade and stage security cause congestion; public transport is preferable.","best":"Check the final demonstration route and programme before travelling.","crowd":"LGBTQ+ people from NRW, community groups, families, performers and allies.","dress":"Pride expression with rain and sun layers.","host":"CSD Düsseldorf is the city's dedicated Pride association.","sources":["https://www.csd-d.de/","https://www.duesseldorf.de/int/tourism/discover/gaylesbian"]},
 {"name":"Marcha del Orgullo Córdoba 2026","city":"cordoba","description":"Córdoba's eighteenth provincial Pride march centres visibility, rights demands, community organisations and public celebration.","link":"https://cordobagay.com/marcha-del-orgullo-cordoba-2026/","date":"2026-11-21","start_date":"2026-11-21T16:00:00-03:00","end_date":"2026-11-21T23:00:00-03:00","location":"Central Córdoba, Argentina; final assembly point to be confirmed","lat":-31.42010,"lng":-64.18880,"vibe":"activist, artistic citywide Pride march with strong trans visibility","q":"Route closures and a late finish require transport planning.","best":"Confirm the final route and assembly point on the organiser channel before travel.","crowd":"LGBTIQNB+ communities, trans organisations, students, artists and allies.","dress":"Political and celebratory Pride expression with sun protection.","host":"Community-led march rooted in Córdoba's sexual-diversity movement.","sources":["https://cordobagay.com/marcha-del-orgullo-cordoba-2026/"]}
